      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "アァ、今頃新作のゲームを遊んでた筈なのニ……。\nもうイイだろウ。\nさっさと星ごと破壊して、終わらせてヤル。",
      "jp_sha256": "01b971fd4cf53800d4ee6f71bdcafccb9596313b52cb9cf744022dd9b2cb9131",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아아, 지금쯤 신작 게임을 하고 있었을 텐데…….\n이제 됐지.\n어서 별째로 파괴해서 끝내 주마.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 30,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "adb8119c66b5be171017ebbdad40702f74b80d7457ae5ef2af368c2037c8fd63:000000_-4680813061416500864:g0:r29",
      "row_index_0based": 29,
