    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "9db1fb63ade1d9d5d5fe9678bad6f946dc6425e663d4c06176d16fa16198fbf2",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 11,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それにしても、さっきのメタルエイリアン、\nやけに強力でしたよね……？\nエルフさん、宝珠がどうとか言ってましたけど……。",
      "jp_sha256": "1559623c7ce7794ec7b302120c0a3b934b393d07361cff19824a3985f22909d1",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그나저나 아까 메탈 에일리언은\n유난히 강력했죠……?\n엘프 씨가 보주가 어쩌고 했는데…….",
      "message_index_0based": 11,
